{"id":"vod_md_6238","vodId":"6238","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"寄生兽 生命的准则","name_cn":"寄生兽 生命的准则","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231026-1/5d563e630ec54dba5182b8c7d445bd0e.jpg"},"summary":"由于残忍的分尸杀人事件频发，世界各地人民陷入一片惶恐不安之中，然而元凶却是人类未曾意料到的“寄生兽”。这些寄生生物的幼虫侵入人类或动物身体后，以寄生脑部为目标，寄生完成后与脑部细胞同化，管理这个“死掉的身体”。它们能任意变形，能够迅速吸收掌握人类知识，而它们的食物便是寄生体相同的物种。普通高中生泉新一（岛崎信长 配音）某天被一只奇怪的虫子侵入身体并吞噬了右手，自此他不得不与寄生生物“右”共存。本性正直善良的泉新一不敢将这一变故告诉家人和朋友，然而他喜欢的人村野里美（花泽香菜 配音）似乎留意到他身体的变化。为了被寄生生物杀死的亲友以及所有人类的未来，泉新一决心与其他完全体寄生兽进行殊死搏斗。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-26 08:33:55","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/Izrbw5Eq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/kDWWtALU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/GVdyY47F/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/BHTR4hcp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/PSvBTT4V/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/PgngbhG1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/a528pQTK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/gRrPkMym/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/TD2GDVG5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/lqjtXWWN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/NPC32axI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/tQhbcxah/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/wWEKYTUg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/dqH7Ol8s/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/SZ2BeqnG/in